    <div class="bz-dialogue">
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Pocket Watch">00:00</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Narrator">A life is not measured by the time left, but by the moments it once held.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Narrator">Life is not only about finishing what you set out to do; it is also about finding yourself along the way.</p>
