<div class="bz-stage">
  <div class="bz-scene">
    <img class="bz-scene-art" src="Images/00：01.jpg" alt="The Final Second">
    <div class="bz-hud">
      <span class="bz-time">00:01</span>
      <span class="bz-memory-tag">Three Memories Recovered</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bz-final-tag">
      <strong>Countdown Finale</strong>
      <b>00:01</b>
      <span>Final Question</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bz-dialogue">
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Pocket Watch">The second hand stops on its final mark.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Mysterious Voice">One final question.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Mysterious Voice">What do you want to leave behind?</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Narrator">The protagonist looks at the three memories: a photo, a ticket, and a drawing, all rising gently in the light.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Protagonist">Not the past.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Protagonist">Not regret.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Protagonist">The moments that made me who I am now.</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[Let Time Reach Zero|00:00]]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


:: 00:10 {"position":"3150,250","size":"100,100"}
