      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Mysterious Voice">But before you go, you still have a chance to see a few things.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Protagonist">Those things... are they what I left behind?</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Mysterious Voice">Perhaps they are the things you thought no longer mattered.</p>
