    </div>
    <div class="bz-dialogue">
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Narrator">He gathers up every memory and places them in the pocket watch, the pain included.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Narrator">The pocket watch becomes very light.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Protagonist">Regret was never something that had to be erased.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Protagonist">It reminds me that I once truly cared.</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[Step Into the Final Second|00:01]]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


:: Ending 3 {"position":"3425,400","size":"100,100"}
<div class="bz-stage">
  <div class="bz-scene">
    <img class="bz-scene-art" src="Images/结局3.jpg" alt="Ending Three">
    <div class="bz-hud">
      <span class="bz-time">Ending</span>
      <span class="bz-place">Staying</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bz-dialogue">
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Narrator">He remains in memory forever.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Narrator">One door after another closes, yet the pocket watch never reaches zero again.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Mysterious Voice">Some believe that if they can hold on to the past, they will never have to leave.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Mysterious Voice">But when something stops, it is never only time.</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[Step Into the Final Second|00:01]]</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


