    </div>
    <div class="bz-dialogue">
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Narrator">As a child, the protagonist lies over the desk drawing, elbows smudged with pencil dust.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Child">Someday I'm going to make something amazing!</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Child">I hope the grown-up me can still like who I am now.</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Narrator">The sentence folds itself like a paper airplane, crosses the years, and lands at his feet.</p>
      <div class="bz-choices">[[Grown Up]]</div>
