      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Protagonist">When did it start...</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Protagonist">When did I forget what I loved?</p>
      <p class="bz-line" data-speaker="Protagonist">My dream... I forgot it a long time ago.</p>
